      "message": "Why go the extra step of turning time points back into uint64_t\u0027s? Interpreting sw_enforced[i].f.dateTime into a time_point should be fine since time_points are durations passed since the epoch. This currently passes the associated tests. Is there another reason I\u0027m missing?",
